<title>SOUTH KOREA: SKorea's Dongbu Steel 1996 net plummets.</title>
<headline>SKorea's Dongbu Steel 1996 net plummets.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 1,383  vs 3,716</p>
<p>    Net					 12.32  vs 31.14</p>
<p>    Revenue				1,004.78  vs 945.82</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     14.79  vs 38.69</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	  Common shares			 8    vs   8</p>
<p>	  Preferred shares		    9    vs   9</p>
<p>Extraordinary</p>
<p>					 (loss)  0.058 vs (gain) 8.95</p>
<p>NOTE: Dongbu Steel Co said its 1996 share capital was unchanged at 10.5 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
